<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">About Mortgage Broker Miami Florida</p><h1>About Matthew Gromadzki</h1><p>Miami-focused mortgage guidance for buyers, homeowners, real estate investors, condo buyers, self-employed borrowers, and Florida homeowners comparing refinance options.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="start.html">Start Mortgage Review</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="get-preapproved-miami.html">Start Preapproval</a><a class="btn btn-secondary" href="tel:+13059884806">Call (305) 988-4806</a></div><div class="trust-row"><span class="trust-pill">NMLS #2560919</span><span class="trust-pill">Miami · Florida</span><span class="trust-pill">Purchase · Refinance · Condo</span></div></div><div class="profile-card"><div class="profile-photo-placeholder"><span>MG</span></div><h2>Matthew Gromadzki</h2><p class="muted">Mortgage guidance for Miami-Dade and Florida borrowers.</p><ul class="clean-list compact-list"><li><strong>NMLS:</strong> #2560919</li><li><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:+13059884806">(305) 988-4806</a></li><li><strong>Text:</strong> <a href="sms:+17863708570">(786) 370-8570</a></li><li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:matthew@mortgagebrokermiamiflorida.com">matthew@mortgagebrokermiamiflorida.com</a></li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container two-col"><article class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">Why this page matters</p><h2>A real mortgage contact for Miami borrowers</h2><p>Mortgage Broker Miami Florida was rebuilt to be a clean, fast, local mortgage resource for people comparing home loan options in Miami, Miami-Dade County, and throughout Florida. The site is designed around practical borrower scenarios rather than generic mortgage filler content.</p><p>Matthew Gromadzki is the primary mortgage contact listed for this website. The goal is to help borrowers understand the documents, property review issues, payment factors, and program options that can affect a purchase, refinance, or investment property loan before they are deep into the process.</p><h2>Mortgage situations Matthew can help review</h2><ul class="check-grid"><li>First-time buyer preapproval in Miami</li><li>Condo financing in Brickell, Edgewater, Miami Beach, and Aventura</li><li>Jumbo mortgage planning for higher-priced Miami properties</li><li>FHA, VA, and conventional loan comparisons</li><li>Self-employed and bank statement loan scenarios</li><li>DSCR and investment property loan scenarios</li><li>Foreign national buyer financing questions</li><li>Cash-out refinance and refinance analysis</li></ul><h2>Local property knowledge matters in Miami</h2><p>Miami mortgage files often involve more than income, credit, and down payment. A condo building may require project review, insurance and HOA details may affect approval, jumbo loans may require more reserves, and investor loans may need a different structure than owner-occupied financing.</p><p>That is why the site includes dedicated pages for <a href="condo-loans-miami.html">Miami condo loans</a>, <a href="non-warrantable-condo-loans-miami.html">non-warrantable condo financing</a>, <a href="jumbo-loans-miami.html">jumbo loans</a>, <a href="bank-statement-loans-miami.html">bank statement loans</a>, <a href="dscr-loans-miami.html">DSCR loans</a>, and <a href="foreign-national-mortgage-miami.html">foreign national mortgage scenarios</a>.</p><h2>The review process</h2><div class="process-list"><div class="process-step"><h3>Understand the borrower goal</h3><p>Purchase, refinance, cash-out refinance, investment property, second home, condo purchase, jumbo loan, or preapproval before making an offer.</p></div><div class="process-step"><h3>Review property and location risks</h3><p>Miami condos, HOA dues, insurance, flood considerations, assessments, occupancy, property type, and closing timeline can all affect the recommended loan path.</p></div><div class="process-step"><h3>Compare possible loan options</h3><p>FHA, conventional, VA, jumbo, DSCR, bank statement, investor, foreign national, and refinance options may have different documentation and underwriting requirements.</p></div><div class="process-step"><h3>Clarify next steps</h3><p>Borrowers should know which documents are needed, what could slow down approval, and whether a full preapproval, quote, or property review is the right next step.</p></div></div><h2>Primary service areas</h2><p>The site covers Miami, Miami-Dade County, Broward County, Palm Beach County, and Florida, with dedicated pages for all Miami-Dade municipalities plus priority neighborhoods.</p><div class="local-link-hub"><a href="miami-dade-mortgage-broker.html">Miami-Dade County <small>All Miami-Dade area pages</small></a><a href="mortgage-broker-brickell.html">Brickell <small>Condo and high-rise mortgage scenarios</small></a><a href="mortgage-broker-coral-gables.html">Coral Gables <small>Conventional and jumbo mortgage options</small></a><a href="mortgage-broker-miami-beach.html">Miami Beach <small>Condo, jumbo, and investor financing</small></a><a href="mortgage-broker-doral.html">Doral <small>Family, investor, and self-employed borrowers</small></a><a href="mortgage-broker-pinecrest.html">Pinecrest <small>Jumbo and luxury property financing</small></a></div></article><aside><form class="lead-form"><h2>Contact Matthew About a Mortgage</h2><p>Answer a few basics and we’ll review the best mortgage path for your scenario.</p><label>Loan goal<select><option>Select one</option><option>Buying a home</option><option>Refinancing</option><option>Cash-out refinance</option><option>Investment property</option><option>Condo financing</option></select></label><div class="form-row"><label>Purchase price / value<input placeholder="$650,000"></label><label>Down payment / equity<input placeholder="$100,000"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Credit score range<select><option>Select range</option><option>760+</option><option>720–759</option><option>680–719</option><option>640–679</option><option>Below 640</option></select></label><label>Property city<input placeholder="Miami"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Name<input></label><label>Phone<input></label></div><label>Email<input type="email"></label><button class="btn btn-primary full" type="button">Start Mortgage Review</button></form><div class="content-card" style="margin-top:18px"><h2>Quick links</h2><ul class="clean-list"><li><a href="contact.html">Contact page</a></li><li><a href="reviews.html">Reviews page</a></li><li><a href="licenses-and-disclosures.html">Licenses & disclosures</a></li><li><a href="privacy-policy.html">Privacy policy</a></li><li><a href="terms.html">Terms</a></li></ul></div></aside></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Helpful next steps</p><h2>Start with the page that matches your situation</h2><div class="card-grid"><a class="feature-card" href="get-preapproved-miami.html"><h3>Get preapproved</h3><p>For buyers who want to make an offer and understand their price range, payment, and document needs.</p><span>Start preapproval →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="miami-condo-loan-review.html"><h3>Condo loan review</h3><p>For buyers considering a Miami condo where project review, insurance, HOA, or reserves may matter.</p><span>Review condo scenario →</span></a><a class="feature-card" href="mortgage-payment-review-miami.html"><h3>Payment review</h3><p>For borrowers comparing monthly payment, cash to close, taxes, insurance, HOA dues, and mortgage insurance.</p><span>Review payment →</span></a></div></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Keep comparing</p><h2>Related mortgage pages</h2><div class="card-grid small-grid"><a class="mini-card" href="contact.html">Contact<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="start.html">Start Review<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="mortgage-broker-miami.html">Mortgage Broker Miami<span>→</span></a><a class="mini-card" href="miami-mortgage-guides.html">Miami Guides<span>→</span></a></div></div></section>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
